# tti-curiobase

Discourse catalogue plugin. Full agent memory: **`AGENTS.md`**. Product docs: **`README.md`**.

## Must not regress

- **Dek first** in cooked DOM (search snippets).
- **Attachment-only posters/plates** — never YouTube / Books / Archive auto-covers.
- Embeds are **baked iframes** in `.cb-stage` (YouTube, Books `output=embed`, Archive `/embed/{id}`).
- Prefer `google_books: VOLUME_ID`; never poison topic cache with probe `"none"` from 429/errors.
- Outside HTTP: `Curiobase.rebake_now!`, not bare `rebake!`.
- Empty series hub: no `add_child(nil)`.
- Gravity: one eligible vote weighs 1 — no supporter group / TL ladder.
- No auto-seeded community wiki post; use Discourse first-post wiki + groups.
- Subject edges: outbound in fence; inbound via `curiobase_edge` CF rows (attribution, not mirror verbs); `same_as` refused; `remember_edges` last after `save_custom_fields`; fan-out debounced (incl. topic trash/recover).
- Association chips: Works-first (not blended All); medium top-10; discussions likes-ranked peer chip.
- Pairing vocabulary = Subject files (not a tag group); tags with a file get `cb-subject-tag`.

## Scratch

Ignore / never commit `tmp/`, `tmp_*`, `node_modules/`.
